{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-03-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIR GROUP TO PARTICIPATE IN J.P MORGAN 2022 INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'SEATTLE, MARCH 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALASKA AIR GROUP INC., THE PARENT COMPANY OF ALASKA AIRLINES INC. AND HORIZON AIR INDUSTRIES INC., TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL WEBCAST A FIRESIDE CHAT WITH CFO SHANE TACKETT AT 1:20 P.M. ET MARCH 15, 2022, FROM THE J.P MORGAN INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE.'}